{
  "$comment": "Synthetic recorded answers from App Store Connect for push.py's tests (the invented Sample Recipes app; every id is made up). Keys are 'METHOD /path?query' as sent; a key ending in * matches by prefix. '$md5:<file>' is the MD5 of that file under out/. '$reserve' answers an upload reservation with parts at https://store-uploads.example.com/upload/<id>/<n>, '$echo' answers a PATCH with its own resource, and '$delivery' answers a poll with that assetDeliveryState.",
